### Get Activity
GET http://localhost:5118/activities/87a273fa-c74b-4300-483a-08df3ab801c5
Accept: application/json

### Get Activity with wrong guid
GET http://localhost:5118/activities/87a273fa-c74b-4300-483a-08df3ab801c9
Accept: application/json

### Get Activity with id wich is not guid
GET http://localhost:5118/activities/12345
Accept: application/json



### Upload GPX file
POST http://localhost:5118/activities
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ride.gpx"
Content-Type: application/gpx+xml

#< ../../tests/Cyclo.Core.Tests/TestData/Private/activity_23911368613.gpx
< ../../../tests/Cyclo.Core.Tests/TestData/Private/big-file-perf.gpx
--Boundary--

###  Unsupported Media Type
POST http://localhost:5118/activities
Content-Type: application/json

###  File larget than 10MB (12 373 KB)
POST http://localhost:5118/activities
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ride.gpx"
Content-Type: application/gpx+xml

< ../../../tests/Cyclo.Core.Tests/TestData/Private/big_file_over_10MB.gpx

